ust be surfaced; discovery IDs must be unique per instance or collisions must be resolved deterministically and observably.\\nProposed spec direction: make DiscoverLocalInstances deduplicate or disambiguate by ID (e.g. suffix the ID from the root path on collision) before returning, or make syncDiscoveredInstances log/record dropped collisions; add a discovery test with two sibling dirs whose names sanitize to the same ID.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"created_by\": \"none\",\n  \"promoted_by\": null,\n  \"promoted_at\": null,\n  \"promotions\": [],\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-09-04T19:39:32.665Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-04T19:39:56.828Z\",\n  \"derived\": {\n    \"terminal\": false,\n    \"waiting\": false,\n    \"open\": true,\n    \"live\": false,\n    \"takeable\": false\n  }\n}\n{\n  \"id\": \"canopy-critic-auditstatus-dead-surface\",\n  \"title\": \"TriggerViewModel.AuditStatus is computed but never rendered\",\n  \"spec\": \"\",\n  \"repo\": \"misty-step/canopy\",\n  \"blocked_by\": [],\n  \"lease\": null,\n  \"ask\": null,\n  \"proof\": null,\n  \"abandoned\": false,\n  \"notes\": [\n    {\n      \"at\": \"2026-09-04T19:39:56.987Z\",\n      \"by\": \"forest-misty-step/canopy\",\n      \"text\": \"filed-by: forest-misty-step/canopy @ misty-step/canopy\\ndeployment: canopy worktree 1788550542915580458-critic, git c203dc9118ace7575d8aab1162f11edc2e3b601a (running build revision unknown)\\nObserved: view.go:61 declares TriggerViewModel.AuditStatus and view.go:344 computes it via triggerStatus(trigger.StateKnown, trigger.AuditError), but no template renders it (grep over templates/*.html shows zero references to AuditStatus) and no test asserts it. The trigger matrix in instance.html renders only PollStatus, RunStatus, and ConsecutiveErrors; AuditError reaches the UI only through the aggregated Errors list (view.go:262-268). This is unused computed surface: it costs a maintenance obligation on every triggerStatus change while contributing nothing observable.\\nRequired: shipped view surface is either consumed by a rendered behavior or removed; per repository conventions the projection should not carry unrendered derived fields.\\nProposed spec direction: either delete TriggerViewModel.AuditStatus and its assignment, or render an Audit column in the trigger matrix if the operator surface is meant to show per-trigger audit state; note the semantics question that view.go:344 reuses StateKnown (poll state) for audit status, which needs its own known flag if rendered.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"created_by\": \"none\",\n  \"promoted_by\": null,\n  \"promoted_at\": null,\n  \"promotions\": [],\n  \"created_at\": \"2026-09-04T19:39:32.827Z\",\n  \"updated_at\": \"2026-09-04T19:39:56.987Z\",\n  \"derived\": {\n    \"terminal\": false,\n    \"waiting\": false,\n    \"open\": true,\n    \"live\": false,\n    \"takeable\": false\n  }\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1788550797027}}
