{"type":"message_update","usage":{"input":2895,"output":701,"cacheRead":48640,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":22,"totalTokens":52236,"cost":{"input":0.00021712499999999998,"output":0.00017525,"cacheRead":0.0007296,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0011219749999999999}},"assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"text_end","contentIndex":1,"content":"# Critic sweep report — worktree 1788550542915580458-critic (git `c203dc9`)\n\nOne sweep, read-only. No code edited, no commits, no publish, no Kernel Effects. `go vet ./...` and `go test ./...` pass as a sanity baseline.\n\n## Surfaces checked\n- **Orientation**: README.md (boundary, inventory, HTTP surface), forest.yaml (repo `misty-step/canopy`, checks). No VISION.md or `docs/adr/` exists (not a finding).\n- **Code**: main.go, app.go, collector.go, discovery.go, inventory.go, model.go, server.go, view.go, and all `*_test.go`.\n- **UI**: templates/{page,fleet,instance,log}.html, static/ (htmx 2.0.9 vendored, canopy.css) — checked polling triggers, empty states, dead template references.\n- **Boundaries**: route validation vs `forest.cli.v2` envelope handling, SSH/local command quoting, freshness/audit classification vs README promises.\n\n## Findings filed (3 drafts, all SPEC-LESS, evidence noted)\n| id | evidence |\n|---|---|\n| `canopy-critic-stale-selected-window` | view.go:172 + view.go:155-157 — 3×interval stale window (6s for the selected instance) is shorter than a legitimate successful Collect (4+N subprocesses, up to 30s each), so healthy instances render \"stale\" with no error. |\n| `canopy-critic-discovery-id-collision` | discovery.go:16 + discovery.go:196-210 + app.go:239-241 — `sanitizeID` collisions across sibling checkouts are silently dropped in `syncDiscoveredInstances` with no log. |\n| `canopy-critic-auditstatus-dead-surface` | view.go:61 + view.go:344 — `TriggerViewModel.AuditStatus` is computed but rendered by no template and asserted by no test; also reuses poll `StateKnown` for audit semantics. |\n\n## Skipped as duplicates of existing open jobs\n- main.go:39 silent default-`canopy.json` load failure → already `if-critic-silent-canopy-config` (open, leased).\n- README omits auto-discovery mechanics → already `canopy-docs-discovery-alignment` (open).\n- Dead collector/app surface incl. unreachable `follow=true` loop → already `if-critic-dead-collector-surface` (open).\n- `sanitizeLogText` redaction untested → already `if-critic-log-sanitize-untested` (open).\n\n## Discarded for lack of a concrete defect\n- `handleFleet` not setting `HX-Trigger-After-Swap` (server.go:47-49) — no reachable flow consumes that combination.\n- Hardcoded 5s discovery ticker (app.go:109) and hardcoded `/misty-step/` boundary (discovery.go:92) — design choices consistent with repo conventions, no contradicting contract found.\n- UI poll intervals hardcoded in templates vs configurable inventory intervals — model.go:31 documents intervals as server-side refresh-loop settings only."}}
